      "principle": "The expression 'wife' as per Section 125 of the Code refers to only legally married wife.",
      "held": "This may be an inadequacy in law, which only the legislature can undo. But as the position in law stands presently there is no escape from the conclusion that the expression 'wife' as per Section 125 of the Code refers to only legally married wife.",
